{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47036","headline":"采莲曲 · 齐己","name":"采莲曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越溪女，越江莲。\n齐菡萏，双婵娟。\n嬉游向何处，采摘且同船。\n浩唱发容与，清波生漪连。\n时逢岛屿泊，几共鸳鸯眠。\n襟袖既盈溢，馨香亦相传。\n薄暮归去来，苎萝生碧烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}